OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FFrance's vast wildfire near Bordeaux,
OL,8,Fwhich scorched an area four times the
OL,9,Fsize of Paris and forced 224,000
OL,10,Fpeople to evacuate, remained contained
OL,11,Fon Sunday, but was still burning.
OL,13,FHundreds of kilometres away, a newer
OL,14,Fblaze in Provence had stopped
OL,15,Fadvancing overnight but was not yet
OL,16,Fcontained.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
