PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785743279
OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FAbout 3,000 firefighters remained
OL,8,Fdeployed across the two fronts,
OL,9,Fextinguishing hot spots, cutting
OL,10,Ffirebreaks and securing areas of
OL,11,Fburned forest as high temperatures and
OL,12,Fwind threatened to breathe new life
OL,13,Finto the blaze.
OL,15,FThe fire in the Gironde region burned
OL,16,Fabout 420 square kilometres in just 10
OL,17,Fdays before authorities declared its
OL,18,Fadvance stopped over the weekend.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
