FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785743279
OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,F"The fire is now fixed, which does not
OL,8,Fmean that the fire is extinguished,"
OL,9,Fthe Gironde prefecture said on Sunday,
OL,10,Fusing the French firefighting term for
OL,11,Fa blaze that has been contained within
OL,12,Fits perimeter.
OL,14,FThe region remained under France's
OL,15,Fhighest red forest-fire alert. Dry
OL,16,Fconditions and soaring temperatures in
OL,17,FBordeaux, along with afternoon winds,
OL,18,Frisked rekindling flames.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
