PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785743279
OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FAdditional firefighters from Ukraine,
OL,8,FLithuania and French Polynesia were
OL,9,Fexpected on Sunday and Monday to
OL,10,Freinforce the operation.
OL,12,FHuman-caused climate change doubled
OL,13,Fthe chances of extreme fire conditions
OL,14,Ffor the flames in France, scientists
OL,15,Fat World Weather Attribution
OL,16,Fcalculated in a rapid analysis on
OL,17,FThursday, conducted while fires were
OL,18,Fstill burning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
