OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FEurope is the world's fastest-warming
OL,8,Fcontinent, with temperatures
OL,9,Fincreasing at twice the speed as the
OL,10,Fglobal average since the 1980s,
OL,11,Faccording to the European Union's
OL,12,FCopernicus Climate Change Service.
OL,14,FThe Gironde blaze prompted one of the
OL,15,Flargest peacetime evacuations in
OL,16,Fmodern French history. Many thousands
OL,17,Fof people remained displaced or unable
OL,18,Fto reach their homes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
