OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785743279
OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FNearly 1,500 firefighters were
OL,8,Fbattling a separate fire that tore
OL,9,Fthrough roughly 18 square kilometres
OL,10,Fin little more than a day.
OL,12,FAuthorities said the blaze in the Gros
OL,13,FBessillon hills was stabilised by
OL,14,FSunday morning, meaning its perimeter
OL,15,Fhad not expanded overnight. But unlike
OL,16,Fthe Gironde fire, it had not yet been
OL,17,Fdeclared contained.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
