OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FFirefighting aircraft supported crews
OL,8,Fworking to keep the flames away from
OL,9,Fvillages set among the vineyards,
OL,10,Folive groves and wooded hills of the
OL,11,Fregion known as Green Provence.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FAbout 2,500 people were evacuated as
OL,19,Fthe fire threatened communities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
