PN,31508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785743279
OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FThe blaze was the fourth major fire to
OL,8,Fstrike the central Var since July 19.
OL,9,FA separate, smaller fire near
OL,10,FBrignoles earlier in the week forced
OL,11,FHollywood star George Clooney and his
OL,12,Ffamily, along with about 700 other
OL,13,Fresidents, to evacuate before it was
OL,14,Fbrought under control.
OL,16,FPrime Minister Sebastien Lecornu said
OL,17,FFrance's wildfires were generally
OL,18,Funder control but cautioned that
OL,19,Fconditions remained highly changeable.
OL,26,@xD@Qrr
