OL,3,CWildfire near Bordeaux contained, as
OL,4,Cfirefighters fight more flames in
OL,5,CProvence
OL,7,FLecornu also announced the appointment
OL,8,Fof a national coordinator to oversee
OL,9,Freconstruction in fire-ravaged areas.
OL,10,FMore than 1,170 square kilometres have
OL,11,Fburned across France since the
OL,12,Fbeginning of the year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
